{"about_the_game":"Batman is dead. A new expansive, criminal underworld has swept the streets of Gotham City. It is now up to the Batman Family - Batgirl, Nightwing, Red Hood, and Robin - to protect Gotham, bring hope to its citizens, discipline to its cops, and fear to its criminals.<br />\r\nFrom solving mysteries that connect the darkest chapters in the city\u2019s history to defeating notorious villains in epic confrontations.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGotham Knights is an open-world, action RPG set in the most dynamic and interactive Gotham City yet. Patrol Gotham\u2019s five distinct boroughs in solo or in co-op and drop in on criminal activity wherever you find it.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour legacy begins now. Step into the Knight.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Loose Ends","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1496790/db98552ac629694dd5ef754e8192966bef36d2f4.jpg"},{"name":"Whispered Words","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1496790/f1c2973d1b52dbaa514801901ee22673140cf933.jpg"},{"name":"Lock and Key","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1496790/c87e11168e6b631f931e300797f5f5d4847a08fd.jpg"},{"name":"Bad Apples in Every Orchard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1496790/01d433069608fb431aa51331c1b7a1c4ee73db8e.jpg"},{"name":"From Inside Gotham's Walls","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1496790/94b5042b15a83dfe9e10919e2312acda7962a5f7.jpg"},{"name":"Voiceless","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1496790/e0a2b9e832b3b2f166f4cfa227175f4de7749868.jpg"},{"name":"To the Victor Go the Spoils","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1496790/8bf6c738b2fa15ad6ebb0132df12ea7d40b588da.jpg"},{"name":"Quartzer Life Crisis","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images